[0.000, "o", "ort declared symbol keys in z.object() (#6448)\r\nd6ca12ae fix(v4): infer recursive getter options in discriminatedUnion (#6422)\r\nb1077f05 perf(memory): install derived internals on a per-constructor prototype (#6415)\r\n07b0c3d8 fix: preserve explicit superRefine issue input (#6053)\r\n79cfedea feat(v4): expose the owning schema on check-originated issues (#6420)\r\n3063993a perf(v4): cut per-schema memory ~90% by moving methods to the prototype (#6318)\r\n11e649d5 Merge pull request #1025 from tmcw/fast-path\r\n---\r\n764ac59f perf(v4): settle z.validate on the first failure in parse order (#6544)\r\nbf990216 perf: move util.cached's accessor to a prototype (#6537)\r\n9782f87c perf(v4): validate without building the output, and keep schemas out of dictionary mode (#6480)\r\nd6ca12ae fix(v4): infer recursive getter options in discriminatedUnion (#6422)\r\n7378e7cd fix(locales): backfill the mac and Sizable.map gaps, and pin dictionary parity (#6427)\r\nccc15144 fix(locales): add the credit_card key to the seven locales missing it ("]
